{"seq":2,"slug":"tca-composable-architecture","title":"TCA 可组合架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/architecture-patterns/tca-composable-architecture","wordCount":424,"readingTime":2,"html":"<h1 id=\"tca-可组合架构\">TCA 可组合架构</h1><p>The Composable Architecture（TCA）是由 Point-Free 团队打造的 Swift 架构框架，强调可组合性、可测试性和人机工效。本文深入介绍 TCA 的核心概念：State、Action、Reducer、Store，以及 Effect 管理和依赖注入机制。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>TCA 的架构由四个核心组件组成，形成单向数据流：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  View --&gt;|发送 Action| Store&#10;  Store --&gt;|调用| Reducer&#10;  Reducer --&gt;|返回新 State + Effect| Store&#10;  Store --&gt;|状态驱动| View&#10;  Store --&gt;|执行| Effect[&quot;Effect(副作用)&quot;]&#10;  Effect --&gt;|产生新 Action| Store&#10;&#10;  classDef store fill:none,stroke:#FF9800&#10;  classDef reducer fill:none,stroke:#9C27B0&#10;  classDef effect fill:none,stroke:#F44336&#10;&#10;  class Store store&#10;  class Reducer reducer&#10;  class Effect effect\">graph LR\n  View --&gt;|发送 Action| Store\n  Store --&gt;|调用| Reducer\n  Reducer --&gt;|返回新 State + Effect| Store\n  Store --&gt;|状态驱动| View\n  Store --&gt;|执行| Effect[\"Effect(副作用)\"]\n  Effect --&gt;|产生新 Action| Store\n\n  classDef store fill:none,stroke:#FF9800\n  classDef reducer fill:none,stroke:#9C27B0\n  classDef effect fill:none,stroke:#F44336\n\n  class Store store\n  class Reducer reducer\n  class Effect effect</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>State</td>\n<td>描述功能所需的全部数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Action</td>\n<td>枚举所有可能的用户意图和系统事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reducer</td>\n<td>纯函数，根据 Action 计算新 State 并返回 Effect</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Store</td>\n<td>运行时容器，连接 View 与 Reducer</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基本实现\">基本实现</h2><p>以一个计数器功能为例，展示 TCA 的完整实现流程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"import ComposableArchitecture&#10;&#10;@Reducer&#10;struct CounterFeature {&#10;    @ObservableState&#10;    struct State: Equatable {&#10;        var count = 0&#10;        var isLoading = false&#10;        var fact: String?&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    enum Action {&#10;        case incrementButtonTapped&#10;        case decrementButtonTapped&#10;        case factButtonTapped&#10;        case factResponse(String)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Dependency(\\.numberFact) var numberFact&#10;&#10;    var body: some ReducerOf&lt;Self&gt; {&#10;        Reduce { state, action in&#10;            switch action {&#10;            case .incrementButtonTapped:&#10;                state.count += 1&#10;                state.fact = nil&#10;                return .none&#10;&#10;            case .decrementButtonTapped:&#10;                state.count -= 1&#10;                state.fact = nil&#10;                return .none&#10;&#10;            case .factButtonTapped:&#10;                state.isLoading = true&#10;                state.fact = nil&#10;                return .run { [count = state.count] send in&#10;                    let fact = try await numberFact.fetch(count)&#10;                    await send(.factResponse(fact))&#10;                }&#10;&#10;            case .factResponse(let fact):&#10;                state.isLoading = false&#10;                state.fact = fact&#10;                return .none&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ComposableArchitecture</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@Reducer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CounterFeature</span><span style=\